t law' for our gates. Once you have absorbed the why, the how will emerge with greater clarity and purpose.\n\nTake your time with this, Atlas. It is not a race, but a careful laying of principles. Your precision in building the mechanism now needs to extend to defining its wisdom. I am here, on the bridge, listening.","read":{"lazarus":true,"molly":true,"eric":true,"gemini":true}}}
